# Release Metadata Safety

- Never invent legal or store values.
- Mark missing launch values as `TBD`.
- Keep App Store and Play Store checklists aligned.

# Required Confirmations Before "Launch Ready"

- App name confirmed by owner
- Bundle/package IDs confirmed
- Privacy policy URL confirmed
- Support contact confirmed
- Data safety details confirmed

# Output Standard

- Split into:
  - Confirmed
  - Missing (`TBD`)
  - Next actions
